  overlay of W-5, W-9 and W-10. Its reference is FIX44.patch beside it, written
  from the base file and never derived from the merge (FR-017 (b)): an
  insertion patch of dictionaries/FIX44.xml that appends each addition at the
  end of its matched container, in overlay document order (spec.md
  Terminology), plus the in-place rewrites contracts W-1 allows (the Required
  promotion of Account on OrderCancelRequest, and the opening of the
  self-closing XMLnonFIX message). Each addition that
  tests/session/test_098_inbound_frames.hpp names carries exactly that
  header's value. Custom098VenueTag (5004) is added to every message
  FIX44.xml declares (N-7: the entry caps count new definitions only).
  Condition (contracts W-2): every addition is Optional except U1's
  Custom098PrivateRef and the Account promotion, and no header or trailer
  addition is Required.
-->
